## Developer Guide ##

**Code Structure**
```text
assoG2P/  
├── bin/                # Core modules  
│   ├── preprocess.py   # Data preprocessing  
│   ├── modeltraining.py # Model training  
│   └── visualization.py # Visualization  
├── main.py             # Main entry  
└── setup.py            # Package configuration  
```
